  ["Tras entregar [Estandartes de batalla] y [Desde las cenizas], acepta [La estrategia de Nek'rosh] del capitán Puñorrecio. Lleva la yesca enana a las catapultas Faucedraco."] = "After turning in [War Banners] and [From the Ashes], accept [Nek'rosh's Gambit] from Captain Stoutfist. Take the dwarven tinder to the Dragonmaw catapults.",
