  ["Misión extra para no quedarte corto de nivel: [Hierro Forjaluz] (nivel 29). Recógela, cumple los objetivos y entrégala."] = "Extra quest so you do not fall behind: [Lightforge Iron] (level 29). Accept it, complete the objectives and turn it in.",
  ["Elige un solo encargo de lingotes. Si el cofre con marcas de agua te ofrece [Los lingotes perdidos], recógela, reúne cinco lingotes y entrégala a Glorin Frenteacerada. Si ya elegiste [Lingotes Forjaluz], sigue esa alternativa."] = "Choose one ingot quest. If the Waterlogged Chest offers [The Lost Ingots], accept it, gather five ingots and turn it in to Glorin Steelbrow. If you already picked [Lightforge Ingots], follow that alternative.",
  ["Si no completaste [Los lingotes perdidos] y Glorin Frenteacerada te ofrece [Lingotes Forjaluz], completa esta alternativa. Reúne cinco lingotes de los múrlocs Aleta Azul cerca del naufragio y vuelve a Glorin."] = "If you have not completed [The Lost Ingots] and Glorin Steelbrow offers [Lightforge Ingots], complete this alternative. Collect five ingots from the Bluegill murlocs near the shipwreck and return to Glorin.",
  ["Misión extra para no quedarte corto de nivel: [Brazo bendito] (nivel 29). Recógela, cumple los objetivos y entrégala."] = "Extra quest so you do not fall behind: [Blessed Arm] (level 29). Accept it, complete the objectives and turn it in.",
