  ["Al 40 cambia a malla con Agilidad: las recompensas de cuero ya casi no te sirven. Busca en la subasta piezas de malla 'del mono' o 'del tigre'. Al 40 cambia también la munición por <Balas precisas>: en Theramore la venden Torq Balacero y Caridad Mipsy. Mazmorras (opcional): las de tu nivel dan mucha experiencia, por sus enemigos y por sus misiones, y conviene hacerlas; tú decides si vas."] = "At 40 switch to mail with Agility: leather rewards are hardly useful anymore. Look at the auction house for mail pieces 'of the Monkey' or 'of the Tiger'. At 40 also switch your ammunition to <Accurate Slugs>: in Theramore Torq Ironblast and Charity Mipsy sell them. Dungeons (optional): the ones at your level give a lot of experience, from their enemies and their quests, and they are worth doing; it is your choice.",
